      "statement": "The pairing contract: a pair is three sibling files (English foo.md, Chinese foo.zh.md, and a consistency record foo.i18n.yaml in the same directory), the consistency record holds the full git blob hash of each side as of the last confirmation, and the Chinese file always links back with `[English](foo.md) | 中文`.",
